# Backend conventions

- Python 3.12, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, DuckDB, Lark, sqlglot.
- RelAlg parsing lives in `app/parsers/relalg`; SQL validation in `app/parsers/sql`.
- Execute only through DuckDB with read-only intent, timeouts, and row limits.
- Reject DDL/DML in SQL mode; allow SELECT (and UNION of SELECTs).
- Add pytest coverage for each new RelAlg operator and parse failure cases.
- Dataset groups use RelaX-compatible `local_groups` text format under `backend/data/`.
